a-county"],["ARC or PLC in Baraga County","/arc-plc/michigan/baraga-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Baraga County&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 33 years, and so did August to September. In 2026 so far, the middle shows April to May at 70% of normal, after January to February at 210% in 2026. Grid 31666 had its driest year in 1976 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
